---
import "@/styles/data/ds.css"
---


<aside>
    <div class="data">
        <h2 class="data-title">磷剃</h2>
        <section>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">名字</h3>
                <div class="data-value">磷剃</div>
            </div>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">名字（英语）</h3>
                <div class="data-value">pramila</div>
            </div>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">生日</h3>
                <div class="data-value">6月2日</div>
            </div>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">
                    <span>珍品藏柜描述</span><i>（可是你没有珍宝柜）</i>
                </h3>
                <div class="data-value">
                    磷剃是一只活蹦乱跳的生物，除睡觉时间外。它呈现绿色，可以利用阳光和储存的水分补充营养。
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">存活的可能性</h3>
                <div class="data-value">适中</div>
            </div>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">能力</h3>
                <div class="data-value">
                    <p>光合作用</p>
                    <p>可以吸水以临时抵抗潮湿</p>
                    <p>不太会打架</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <h2 class="data-title">体质</h2>
        <section>
            <div class="data-item">
                <div class="data-vitals">
                    <p class="data-vital">
                        [生命] 120 <small>(0.8)</small>
                    </p>
                    <p class="data-vital">
                        [饥饿] 150 <small>(1)</small>
                    </p>
                    <p class="data-vital">
                        [潮湿] 300 <small>(3)</small>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="data-item">
                <h3 class="data-label">最爱食物</h3>
                <div class="data-value">
                    [火龙果派] <i
                        >疑似亲友入口即化？但我也没说它是仙人掌，最多有基因重组的关系。</i>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        </div>
    </aside>


